WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.534
-The chief of staff

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.234
to former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.767
was so worried that Donald Trump

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.067
would put Pence's
physical safety at risk

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.501
in the run-up to the attempted
coup on January 6th

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:12.634
that he told the Secret Service
about it,

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:13.934
a prediction that was borne out

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.267
when Trump sicced
a violent mob on the Capitol

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.367
and reportedly spoke approvingly

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:20.567
of the mob chanting,
"Hang Mike Pence."

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.300
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.701
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.734
The endless bad faith and lying
from the Republican Party

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.634
just keeps getting more
and more exhausting.

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.400
For example,
Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.501
recently tried to blame
the Biden administration

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.367
for rising electricity prices
in his state, tweeting...

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:48.367
Two things -- first of all,
Texas has its own power grid,

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:49.968
where electricity is generated

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:51.734
and used only
within state lines.

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:54.634
So, Texas' electric grid
is separate

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:56.434
from the rest of the country.
You know, the way you

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.534
become separate from the country
every time there's

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.367
[ Laughter ]
a crisis in your state.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:03.133
No surprise that Cruz is a liar,

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:04.901
though, doesn't he just
look like the guy

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.834
who shows up
in an Old West Town

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:09.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
and promises he can make it rain

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:11.067
if you give him
a few bars of gold?

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.567
[ Laughter ]
Then, the next morning,
when it doesn't rain,

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:14.133
a group of townspeople go
to his room

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.033
and find a note that says,
"So long, suckers!"

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:18.367
[ Laughter ]
So, they go to the stable
and he's still there

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:19.701
because he couldn't
figure out how

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:20.934
to get the saddle on his horse
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.801
and they just beat
the living crap out of him.

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:25.400
Doesn't he just look
like that guy?

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.534
Second, Democrats,

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:29.501
much to the dismay
of progressives

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:30.934
and anyone who doesn't
want the planet

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:33.367
to turn into a climate
change-induced apocalypse

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:35.634
have not passed
the Green New Deal.

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.133
This is yet another reminder
that Democrats

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:38.968
should do more stuff because,
whether they do or not,

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:40.400
Republicans are going
to attack them for it.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.868
They don't care if it's true.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:44.067
Ted Cruz is going to bitch
about how Biden

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:45.968
outlawed red meat
and took his guns away

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:49.234
while he flips burgers
with the butt end of his AR-15.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:51.334
[ Laughter and applause ]
When everyone rushed --

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:53.200
When everyone rushed
to fact-check Cruz,

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.734
he then followed up by claiming
that natural gas prices

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:58.467
have doubled because
of Green New Deal policies,

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:01.901
which, again, is insane,
since the Green New Deal

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:03.767
is not, and has never been, law.

00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:05.534
In fact, if anything,
rising energy prices

00:02:05.534 --> 00:02:07.767
are even more reason
to pass a Green New Deal,

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:09.567
so we can generate
our own renewable energy

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:11.601
right here in the U.S.,
instead of being held hostage

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:14.367
to global energy markets
dictated, in large part,

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:17.467
by oil-based autocracies,
like Russia and Saudi Arabia.

00:02:17.467 --> 00:02:20.033
If you ask me, I'd much prefer
to get my electricity

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:22.634
from a wind turbine
or a solar panel on my roof

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:23.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
than a bloodthirsty dictator.

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:26.534
Plus, plus, wind turbines
have the added benefit

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:28.033
of annoying the [bleep]
out of Donald Trump,

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:29.367
[ Laughter and applause ]
who, notoriously,

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:31.267
[ Cheering ]
hates them and, and,

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:33.133
and thinks they sound
like this --

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:34.634
-Rirr, rirr!

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:37.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.968
-I think --

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.934
I think he's confusing
wind turbines with cats.

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:45.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.167
[ As Trump ]
Windmills go like this --

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:47.133
"Rirr, rirr!

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.167
Meow, meow.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:48.934
[ Hiss ]"

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:50.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.968
Anyway, the point is
Republicans are shameless liars.

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.234
Well, I guess
that was the point.

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:56.267
[ Laughter ]
I mean, it is "A Closer Look"

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:57.868
and that's usually
the point of these.

00:02:57.868 --> 00:02:59.667
[ Laughter ]
Here's another example --

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:01.801
Colorado Congresswoman
Lauren Boebert tweeted

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:07.901
this incredibly dumb retort
to calls for more gun control...

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:11.734
And, yes, it's true,
it stands for ArmaLite rifle.

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:15.133
And, as someone who has made
that mistake myself in the past,

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:17.934
I would just like to issue
this sincere apology

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.901
to Lauren Boebert --
I'm sorry

00:03:19.901 --> 00:03:21.234
for not giving a [bleep].

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:22.567
[ Laughter and applause ]
I mean, I love --

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:25.701
I love that the same people --
the same people who say,

00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:28.133
"I don't care what your pronouns
are," also say --

00:03:28.133 --> 00:03:31.033
[ As Boebert ]
Don't get the name
of my gun wrong!

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:35.000
[ Laughter and applause ]
My gun has feelings, too.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.734
Anyway, the point is this is
the modern Republican Party --

00:03:37.734 --> 00:03:40.901
a collection of ghoulish
conmen and weirdos saying

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:42.734
and doing whatever they think
they can get away with

00:03:42.734 --> 00:03:43.901
to gain and hold on to power.

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:45.767
The most recent example
of this trend

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:48.400
is the fact that the GOP nominee
for Senate in Pennsylvania

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.234
is now officially
none other than Dr. Oz.

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:55.701
[ Laughter ]
I mean, how can you be
the best man for the job

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:58.701
when you're not even the best
"Oprah" doctor spinoff?

00:03:58.701 --> 00:04:01.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
I'm -- I'm not saying Dr. Phil

00:04:01.534 --> 00:04:04.868
would be a good senator,
but at least he'd have a plan,

00:04:04.868 --> 00:04:07.033
if your team
started dressing too sexy.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:09.734
[ Laughter ]
I never thought Dr. Oz

00:04:09.734 --> 00:04:11.267
would be a nominee
for anything other than

00:04:11.267 --> 00:04:13.033
The New England Journal
of Medicine's annual

00:04:13.033 --> 00:04:14.434
Craziest Doctor Alive! Issue.

00:04:14.434 --> 00:04:15.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:17.701
This guy is
a notorious scam artist,

00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:20.167
according to many
of his colleagues and peers.

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:22.267
When four out of five
doctors agree,

00:04:22.267 --> 00:04:23.634
he's the other doctor.

00:04:23.634 --> 00:04:25.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:25.133 --> 00:04:26.901
And, just like almost
every other

00:04:26.901 --> 00:04:28.901
successful Republican politician
in the country,

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.968
Oz has learned that,
in order to thrive

00:04:30.968 --> 00:04:33.434
in today's GOP
and court the Republican base,

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:35.901
you have to embrace
election denialism

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.734
by implying there was
widespread fraud in 2020,

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:40.834
when we all know
that there was not.

00:04:40.834 --> 00:04:44.000
-The reality for me is 2020,
under the cover of COVID,

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.167
was an example of how you
should not run an election.

00:04:47.167 --> 00:04:49.934
Here in Pennsylvania, people are
really worked up about it.

00:04:49.934 --> 00:04:51.701
I already said,
on the debate stage,

00:04:51.701 --> 00:04:54.300
I was the first to say
we cannot leave 2020 behind.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:56.801
We have to get under the hood,
examine exactly what went down,

00:04:56.801 --> 00:04:58.200
and address those issues.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.934
There are so many different
things that happened.

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:01.434
As you really,
really examine it --

00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:02.767
As a physician, you know,

00:05:02.767 --> 00:05:04.434
I like to get
into the details.

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:05.801
I've talked to individuals

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:07.400
who say their votes
weren't counted,

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.100
who went to the polls
and claimed

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.567
that someone had already voted
with their absentee ballot.

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:13.868
We have got to understand
the different ways

00:05:13.868 --> 00:05:16.234
where cheating occurred,
so we can, first of all,

00:05:16.234 --> 00:05:17.467
identify how much happened,

00:05:17.467 --> 00:05:19.567
but also make sure
that it never happens again.

00:05:19.567 --> 00:05:21.167
-I understand that,
as a physician,

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:22.567
you want to get
into the details,

00:05:22.567 --> 00:05:24.567
but there are also times
you just don't have to.

00:05:24.567 --> 00:05:27.133
If a patient came in
and said their arm fell off,

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:28.534
but you could see
that it hadn't,

00:05:28.534 --> 00:05:30.767
you probably wouldn't order
a full set of tests.

00:05:30.767 --> 00:05:32.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
You'd probably, you know,

00:05:32.067 --> 00:05:33.767
you'd send them off
to a different doctor,

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:36.200
who did, you know, brain stuff,
which is

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.567
[ Laughter ]
what we used to do to anyone

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:38.767
who said their vote
wasn't counted

00:05:38.767 --> 00:05:40.667
because I doubt
these people knew that.

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:43.133
Did their sticker also have
tiny writing on it?

00:05:43.133 --> 00:05:45.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:45.767 --> 00:05:48.400
But this is the ideological
heart of the GOP --

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.267
conmen and scam artists
embracing the lie

00:05:51.267 --> 00:05:53.334
that any election
they lose is illegitimate.

00:05:53.334 --> 00:05:56.934
That was the lie that fueled
the coup attempt on January 6th

00:05:56.934 --> 00:06:00.667
and the GOP is as committed
as ever to defending that lie,

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:02.734
a lie that we now know

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:04.634
almost got Trump's own
vice president killed.

00:06:04.634 --> 00:06:06.133
In fact,
we just recently learned that,

00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:07.601
even in advance of January 6th,

00:06:07.601 --> 00:06:09.968
Pence's team was so worried
that Trump was intentionally

00:06:09.968 --> 00:06:12.100
putting Pence at risk
of physical danger

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.834
that they alerted
the Secret Service.

00:06:13.834 --> 00:06:16.334
-A stunning new report
in The New York Times says

00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:18.934
that a top aide to former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:06:18.934 --> 00:06:21.334
warned the Secret Service
that President Trump

00:06:21.334 --> 00:06:23.200
could turn on the vice president

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.300
and the aide feared
for Pence's safety

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.434
on the eve of the Capitol riot.

00:06:27.434 --> 00:06:30.400
The Times report claims Pence's
chief of staff, Marc Short,

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.267
warned the Secret Service
of his safety concerns

00:06:33.267 --> 00:06:35.334
one day before the insurrection.

00:06:35.334 --> 00:06:37.501
-This falls into the category
of one of those stories

00:06:37.501 --> 00:06:39.968
that's both incredibly shocking
and not at all surprising.

00:06:39.968 --> 00:06:41.901
I mean, of course, Trump was
putting Pence in danger.

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:42.667
That was the point.

00:06:42.667 --> 00:06:43.934
He was threatening Pence

00:06:43.934 --> 00:06:45.033
with physical violence,

00:06:45.033 --> 00:06:46.367
unless Pence gave him
what he wanted.

00:06:46.367 --> 00:06:48.434
The dude spent a lifetime
in New York real estate.

00:06:48.434 --> 00:06:49.868
He knows how to act
like a mobster.

00:06:49.868 --> 00:06:52.133
[ Laughter ]
You think he never sat
behind a desk,

00:06:52.133 --> 00:06:53.601
threatening a city
planning commissioner

00:06:53.601 --> 00:06:56.200
while petting a cat?
Or, in Trump's case,

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.234
Rudy Giuliani?

00:06:57.234 --> 00:06:58.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:58.501 --> 00:07:01.300
[ As Giuliani ]
Oh.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.934
Oh, that's right, that's right,

00:07:02.934 --> 00:07:04.634
I love it right
behind the ears, boss.

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:06.367
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ] Be quiet.

00:07:06.367 --> 00:07:08.367
Be quiet, furry windmill.

00:07:08.367 --> 00:07:11.033
[ Laughter and applause ]
In fact, even after the mob

00:07:11.033 --> 00:07:12.934
tried to follow through
on Trump's directive

00:07:12.934 --> 00:07:15.334
and stormed the Capitol,
chanting, "Hang Mike Pence,"

00:07:15.334 --> 00:07:16.267
Trump didn't back down.

00:07:16.267 --> 00:07:18.067
He ignored repeated pleas

00:07:18.067 --> 00:07:20.400
from even the people closest
to him to quell the mob

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.934
and he reportedly even told
his then-chief of staff,

00:07:22.934 --> 00:07:27.467
Mark Meadows, that he thought
maybe Pence should be hanged.

00:07:27.467 --> 00:07:29.801
-Stunning new reporting
on the investigation

00:07:29.801 --> 00:07:31.667
into the January 6th attack

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:34.300
concerning Donald Trump
and his reaction

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.767
to the chants
from his supporters

00:07:35.767 --> 00:07:39.467
outside of the Capitol that day
to, "Hang Mike Pence"...

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.934
-"Maybe Mike Pence should be
hanged" is a reminder

00:08:17.934 --> 00:08:21.501
that Trump is both a monster
and wishy-washy?

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:25.467
[ Laughter ]
I mean, if there's ever a time
to come down firmly

00:08:25.467 --> 00:08:27.300
on one side or the other...
[ Laughter ]

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.868
...it's "Should we hang
the vice president?"

00:08:29.868 --> 00:08:33.467
[ Laughter ]
I mean, Trump would've made
a terrible Queen of Hearts.

00:08:33.467 --> 00:08:35.067
[ As Trump ]
Off with his head.
Or maybe,

00:08:35.067 --> 00:08:37.033
maybe we leave it on.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:37.033 --> 00:08:39.400
A lot of people are saying,
"Get that head outta here!",

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.534
but you can also make a case
for keeping the head.

00:08:41.534 --> 00:08:44.567
We love -- We love the head,
don't we, folks?

00:08:44.567 --> 00:08:47.000
[ Laughter ]
It has, oh, so many great parts.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.167
I mean, the eyes, the ears.

00:08:49.167 --> 00:08:51.334
Don't forget the nose!
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.334 --> 00:08:53.534
And the most --
the beautiful mouth.

00:08:53.534 --> 00:08:55.934
[ Laughter ]

00:08:55.934 --> 00:08:57.434
[ Applause ]

00:08:57.434 --> 00:08:59.567
Remember, I mean --

00:08:59.567 --> 00:09:02.100
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.634
We're waiting for all of this
and more to finally come out

00:09:04.634 --> 00:09:05.901
when the January 6th Committee

00:09:05.901 --> 00:09:07.467
holds its first
televised hearings,

00:09:07.467 --> 00:09:09.601
beginning this Thursday
in primetime.

00:09:09.601 --> 00:09:11.767
Now, if you ask me, they
should've done this a while ago

00:09:11.767 --> 00:09:13.901
and a lot more people should
already be in jail by now,

00:09:13.901 --> 00:09:15.234
but better late than never,
I guess.

00:09:15.234 --> 00:09:17.501
And, yet, the Trump team's
argument is mainly

00:09:17.501 --> 00:09:20.267
that no one's going to watch,
a point former Trump spokesman

00:09:20.267 --> 00:09:22.367
Jason Miller made
over the weekend.

00:09:22.367 --> 00:09:25.367
-This is basically just
an echo chamber,

00:09:25.367 --> 00:09:26.701
a lefty echo chamber,

00:09:26.701 --> 00:09:28.567
where they think,
in their minds,

00:09:28.567 --> 00:09:30.167
"Well, people at home
will stop what they're doing

00:09:30.167 --> 00:09:31.467
at 8:00 pm at night."

00:09:31.467 --> 00:09:33.868
No, you're getting the kids
put to bed

00:09:33.868 --> 00:09:34.801
or getting done
with the homework

00:09:34.801 --> 00:09:36.067
or you're watching sports.

00:09:36.067 --> 00:09:38.534
We talk about the finals --
Stanley Cup or NBA.

00:09:38.534 --> 00:09:41.501
You're going to stop and watch
Liz Cheney, Bennie Thompson,

00:09:41.501 --> 00:09:43.801
Adam Kinzinger?
No.

00:09:43.801 --> 00:09:46.534
Now, we're getting into the
summer. We're into June.

00:09:46.534 --> 00:09:48.467
People have better things
to do in their lives.

00:09:48.467 --> 00:09:50.400
-Dude, no one's expecting
millions of viewers

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.133
to change channels en masse
from the NBA Finals

00:09:53.133 --> 00:09:55.434
to a congressional hearing,
and I don't blame them.

00:09:55.434 --> 00:09:57.534
I'd also rather watch
the NBA Finals, even though

00:09:57.534 --> 00:09:59.067
I'd think about Jason Miller
the whole time

00:09:59.067 --> 00:10:00.133
because his head is the shape

00:10:00.133 --> 00:10:02.133
of a partially deflated
basketball.

00:10:02.133 --> 00:10:05.267
[ Laughter and applause ]
Also, no one should be
surprised that Congress --

00:10:05.267 --> 00:10:08.400
Congress -- picked the worst
time to start these hearings.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.300
I mean, way to wait
until the summer,

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:13.234
when people famously watch
the most TV.

00:10:13.234 --> 00:10:14.634
"Oh, it's 85°.

00:10:14.634 --> 00:10:16.801
Should we take the boat out
on the lake with a cold six-pack

00:10:16.801 --> 00:10:19.701
or stay inside
to watch the hearings?"
[ Laughter ]

00:10:19.701 --> 00:10:21.701
But no one's trying to compete
with the NBA finals

00:10:21.701 --> 00:10:23.801
and that's not the point.
The point is to document

00:10:23.801 --> 00:10:25.467
what happened in the lead-up
to the coup attempt

00:10:25.467 --> 00:10:27.334
because Republicans
are going to try it again.

00:10:27.334 --> 00:10:29.567
Do you think Donald Trump's
just going to give up

00:10:29.567 --> 00:10:31.601
after almost getting his own
vice president killed?

00:10:31.601 --> 00:10:34.267
Trump's like the Wile E. Coyote
to Pence's Roadrunner.

00:10:34.267 --> 00:10:36.334
[ Laughter ]
Remember that insane
Oval Office meeting

00:10:36.334 --> 00:10:38.467
where Pence sat totally still
with his eyes closed,

00:10:38.467 --> 00:10:39.901
hoping no one would notice him?

00:10:39.901 --> 00:10:42.701
[ Laughter ]
He learned that from cartoons.

00:10:42.701 --> 00:10:44.133
What people don't remember
is that,

00:10:44.133 --> 00:10:45.400
at the end of that meeting,

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.734
Pence held up a little sign
that said...

00:10:47.734 --> 00:10:49.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:49.434 --> 00:10:51.434
The shameless bad faith
of the GOP,

00:10:51.434 --> 00:10:53.434
in trying to whitewash
an attempted coup,

00:10:53.434 --> 00:10:55.334
remains both shocking
and also not surprising,

00:10:55.334 --> 00:10:58.467
which is why we need a full,
clear, exhaustive account

00:10:58.467 --> 00:11:00.067
of everything that went
into their plan,

00:11:00.067 --> 00:11:02.567
so we can, hopefully,
stop it from happening again.

00:11:02.567 --> 00:11:05.801
We need to sound the alarm now
and hope that everyone hears it.

00:11:05.801 --> 00:11:08.067
Maybe it would help if the alarm
sounded like this --

00:11:08.067 --> 00:11:09.334
-Rirr, rirr!

00:11:09.334 --> 00:11:10.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:10.601 --> 00:11:12.534
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:12.534 --> 00:11:15.734
♪♪

00:11:15.734 --> 00:11:17.234
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:11:17.234 --> 00:11:18.534
