00:11:18.534 --> 00:11:20.501
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:11:20.501 --> 00:11:22.100
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.901
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:11:23.901 --> 00:11:26.300
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:28.968
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

